Test-only self-signed certificates for localhost/127.0.0.1 (valid 20 years): `hub` plays a
hub's registered certificate, `other` a different one for the same names. Made with
`openssl req -x509 -newkey ec -pkeyopt ec_paramgen_curve:P-256 -nodes -days 7300
-addext "subjectAltName=DNS:localhost,IP:127.0.0.1"`. The keys are not secret.
